<title>USA: Eastern Iowa CC, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</title>
<headline>Eastern Iowa CC, Iowa, won by Piper Jaffray.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray Inc. said it won $1.140 million of Eastern Iowa CC, Iowa, industrial new jobs training AMT certificates, Series 1997 D, with a true interest cost of 4.92 percent.</p>
</text>
